        <p>Intended levels (<code class="inline-code">CORE_V1</code>, <code class="inline-code">LOCAL_PROJECTION_V1</code>, <code class="inline-code">REMOTE_STORE_V1</code>, <code class="inline-code">ATOMIC_BATCH_VISIBILITY_V1</code>, <code class="inline-code">SPECIALIZED_DIFF_V1</code>) have no test harness in this repository. CORE_V1 cannot be claimed without mandatory test vectors.</p>
